### 6. Reject — non-multipart request
POST {{baseUrl}}/staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ShouldFail",
  "roles": ["stylist"]
}

### 7. Get all staff
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff

### 8. Get one staff (replace with a real id from a previous response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### 9. Update staff (JSON — PATCH is unchanged, no photo support here)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/staff/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nino Updated",
  "roles": ["stylist", "colorist", "makeup"]
}

### 10. Delete staff
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/staff/REPLACE_WITH_ID